WEBVTT

00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:07.733
What's happened?!

00:02:07.766 --> 00:02:08.766
We've been hit!

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.500
It's the power station
in Section D!

00:02:10.533 --> 00:02:11.733
Damn. Not again...

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.670
Find the culprit!
They should definitely be nearby!

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:19.833
What's this?

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:34.670
THE NOBLEWOMAN'S TRAP

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.370
I'm glad you could come, Logi.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.570
Long time no see.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.470
Glad you came,
glad you came.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:49.966
It has been a long time,
Lord Nene.

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:53.573
I went to the trouble
of summoning you

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.170
to ask you to do something.

00:02:56.533 --> 00:02:58.203
Yes, sir! As you command!

00:02:58.633 --> 00:02:59.633
Szabo.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.070
Yes, sir.

00:03:05.266 --> 00:03:07.696
Please explain things to Logi.

00:03:08.133 --> 00:03:09.973
Please, please.

00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:13.333
As you know, the on-going
reconstruction project

00:03:13.366 --> 00:03:16.766
on the royal city will be
completed very soon.

00:03:17.433 --> 00:03:20.133
You know that 80% of
the work is already done

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:24.026
and that only
the fine-tuning remains.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:31.270
As a result, a slight number of troops,
charged with protecting the project,

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:34.530
will now be available
for re-assignment.

00:03:34.733 --> 00:03:36.633
It'll be a waste to let them
just sit around.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.870
And so I've decided to
have you lead an army.

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:42.873
An army, an army!

00:03:43.133 --> 00:03:44.773
I am honored.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.900
It's a Flying Squadron with
Shadow Wielders as the main strength.

00:03:49.033 --> 00:03:53.373
From now on, I'll have you work to the max,
regardless of local or central.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:55.773
Yes, sir. Leave it to me.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.100
Let's see.

00:03:57.133 --> 00:04:01.233
For starters, maybe I'll have you destroy
those meddlesome Shadow Wielders.

00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:04.633
Zola and the others?
But they're...

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.300
They are not a threat to us yet.

00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:15.296
However, we don't know
what will happen in the future.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.600
Am I wrong?

00:04:26.066 --> 00:04:27.426
You are right, sir.

00:04:28.433 --> 00:04:30.903
Please destroy them for me
while we have the chance.

00:04:30.933 --> 00:04:32.473
Please, please.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.470
Before the sapling becomes
a giant tree.

00:04:36.133 --> 00:04:36.803
As you wish.

00:04:59.066 --> 00:05:01.496
Hornet Assassin!

00:05:19.733 --> 00:05:23.803
But to think that Gorky would
fall from that situation.

00:05:30.666 --> 00:05:31.866
That boy...

00:05:38.866 --> 00:05:40.126
That fleet...

00:05:41.433 --> 00:05:42.603
I haven't heard about it.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.470
Yes, sir. I believe
Lieutenant Dragnov is in charge.

00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:50.133
So the lucky Dragnov has
also gone to battle, huh?

00:05:50.633 --> 00:05:53.603
Then the object in question
has been completed...

00:06:05.633 --> 00:06:07.403
That's Jibral Castle, huh?

00:06:09.233 --> 00:06:11.103
Isn't it an amazing castle?

00:06:11.433 --> 00:06:13.473
It's a huge castle, maro...

00:06:13.566 --> 00:06:16.326
That's called a fortified town, right?

00:06:16.466 --> 00:06:17.126
Maro?

00:06:17.633 --> 00:06:20.433
It means a town with the castle
and town together.

00:06:20.633 --> 00:06:23.473
Correct! In the nation of Jibral,

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.970
everything is contained
within the castle walls.

00:06:26.266 --> 00:06:29.496
Moreover, this is the one and
only object of this scale in this world.

00:06:37.033 --> 00:06:39.403
Everything's going to be fine
now we've made it this far.

00:06:39.933 --> 00:06:45.303
Great work, you guys!
Delightful! Delightful!

00:06:46.266 --> 00:06:48.326
It wasn't our intention to work,
I tell you.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.870
Legalas, I'm sure I don't need
to remind you...

00:06:51.233 --> 00:06:52.973
Right. Leave it to me.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:56.900
I haven't forgotten about
the reward for you guys.

00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:58.166
Hey, you there.

00:07:02.966 --> 00:07:05.596
Judging from appearances,
you look to be with the military.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.830
Could you give me your name
and affiliation?

00:07:10.333 --> 00:07:11.673
My name is Legalas!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.900
I'm the Regional Inspector General
for the nation of Jibral!

00:07:14.933 --> 00:07:19.973
I'm here with an important report
for central command!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:23.370
Hey...

00:07:28.166 --> 00:07:29.366
There's no report.

00:07:29.933 --> 00:07:31.073
And, this man...

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.900
In the records,
he's supposed to be dead.

00:07:37.466 --> 00:07:38.466
What did you say?!

00:07:39.133 --> 00:07:40.133
What's the matter?

00:07:40.266 --> 00:07:43.266
Pardon me, but we're going to have
to look into this further.

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:45.270
Huh?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.070
- Please come this way.
- Hey!

00:07:46.166 --> 00:07:47.296
Huh? Huh?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.230
Huh? What's going on?

00:07:49.633 --> 00:07:50.633
Stop!

00:07:50.966 --> 00:07:54.466
- What's going on here?
- Stop. Let me go! Hey!

00:07:54.733 --> 00:07:56.603
Are you guys with him?

00:07:56.833 --> 00:07:59.033
No... Not exactly...

00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:00.073
I see.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.400
If you're travelers, then it's natural
that you don't know.

00:08:02.733 --> 00:08:05.973
There's a bit of a ghost disturbance
happening in this town.

00:08:06.266 --> 00:08:07.726
A ghost disturbance?

00:08:07.933 --> 00:08:08.603
Maro?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.470
There are all kinds of strange incidents
occurring all over the town...

00:08:13.133 --> 00:08:15.103
The inside of shops
being ransacked...

00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:18.203
The power plant being decorated
with flowers...

00:08:18.666 --> 00:08:21.766
Benches and trees in the park
being turned upside down...

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:25.030
They're all like large-scale pranks,

00:08:25.066 --> 00:08:27.426
but we cannot just
leave things be,

00:08:27.466 --> 00:08:28.626
so we've increased our patrols.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.070
And now, we've discovered someone
using the name of a dead military officer.

00:08:32.766 --> 00:08:33.426
Good day!

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.100
He's gone...

00:08:36.533 --> 00:08:40.273
So that old man Legalas wasn't
an important person, maro?

00:08:43.966 --> 00:08:47.726
Jeez, why do I have to go
through something like this?

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:50.200
That guard... Just you wait!

00:08:50.433 --> 00:08:54.103
I'll kick your butt real good and...

00:08:54.933 --> 00:08:57.033
So you've finally realized
your mistake, huh?!

00:08:57.333 --> 00:09:00.903
See? I was telling the truthâ€”

00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:05.566
W-What?!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.100
It's interrogation time.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.900
I won't let you sleep today.

00:09:17.866 --> 00:09:19.496
What do we do now, Zola?

00:09:19.866 --> 00:09:21.126
Plans have fallen through.

00:09:21.366 --> 00:09:23.426
I wanted to have Legalas act
as a go-between

00:09:23.466 --> 00:09:25.326
and get us in for a meeting
with the King.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.070
The King?

00:09:26.366 --> 00:09:27.626
Even if he weren't captured,

00:09:27.666 --> 00:09:31.896
you wouldn't be able to meet the King
with a fake military officer.

00:09:31.966 --> 00:09:34.366
No, Legalas isn't lying.

00:09:34.633 --> 00:09:38.933
He was probably killed on the records
when he became a prisoner.

00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:44.566
Meet the King, huh?
Doesn't seem feasible...

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.100
Maro.

00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:51.933
Then how about we solve
that mystery?

00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:53.003
- Huh?
- Maro?

00:09:53.266 --> 00:09:57.896
Kings give rewards
for great deeds, right?

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.930
Maro! That's good, maro!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.900
If we solve the problem,
the King might meet with us!

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.300
So we come all the way to Jibral
to play detective, huh?

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:08.070
What aâ€”

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.130
That just might work.

00:10:09.666 --> 00:10:10.326
Huh?

00:10:10.766 --> 00:10:12.896
Something concerns me a little too.

00:10:13.566 --> 00:10:14.696
Then it's settled!

00:10:14.933 --> 00:10:17.373
We'll split up and
gather information!

00:10:17.633 --> 00:10:18.903
- Right!
- Maro!

00:10:19.366 --> 00:10:20.666
R-Right...

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:48.670
All right.
Let's hear everyone's information!

00:10:48.933 --> 00:10:50.733
Then, I'll go first!

00:10:51.666 --> 00:10:54.596
First, the incidents always
happen at night.

00:10:54.933 --> 00:10:58.633
They're all like large-scale pranks.

00:10:59.033 --> 00:11:01.273
No matter how tightly
people lock up,

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.930
someone sneaks in as if to
taunt and pulls a prank.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.600
A locked-room murder, huh?

00:11:07.633 --> 00:11:09.133
No, that wouldn't be it...

00:11:09.533 --> 00:11:12.733
It seems the rumor that a ghost
was responsible got started

00:11:12.766 --> 00:11:16.596
since so many incidents have occurred
in places where people can't get into.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.800
No, it's not just that.

00:11:19.866 --> 00:11:21.566
It seems there were
some witnesses.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.730
According to their statements,

00:11:23.766 --> 00:11:24.996
it seems the culprit is
a noblewoman,

00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:27.373
who carries an umbrella and
wears moth-eaten clothes.

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.830
The fact that this turned
into a ghost disturbance

00:11:29.866 --> 00:11:31.096
is probably because of
that appearance.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:35.100
No, no.
The culprit is a real ghost, maro.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.570
Fifty years ago, a noblewoman who
was the wife of a trading merchant

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.770
was falsely accused of
her husband's murder,

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:44.470
and was locked up in a dungeon
and met a horrible end, maro.

00:11:44.566 --> 00:11:48.266
They say her ghost wanders through
the town each and every night, maro.

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.600
Hey, stop stuff like that.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.770
Come on, are you scared?

00:11:52.866 --> 00:11:55.326
Keep your mouth shut!

00:11:55.366 --> 00:11:58.096
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:11:58.366 --> 00:12:01.866
But I don't get it.
What's the culprit's purpose?

00:12:02.233 --> 00:12:06.203
Yeah. Nothing good will come
from doing stuff like that.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:10.530
Rather than guessing, why don't we
ask the perpetrator directly.

00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:15.296
From today, we'll search
the town every day.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.530
Um, that'll be at night, right?

00:12:17.866 --> 00:12:18.866
Of course.

00:12:19.333 --> 00:12:21.873
Testing your courage during the day
wouldn't be any fun, right?

00:12:28.133 --> 00:12:30.003
Hey, what're you screaming for?

00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:31.366
Huh?! Oh...

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:34.300
If you're going to scream,
scream after something's happened, maro.

00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:36.133
Come on.
Stop playing and let's go.

00:12:40.266 --> 00:12:40.926
Oh...

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.670
H-Hey, wait up!

00:12:56.766 --> 00:12:58.226
Are you even trying?

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.170
Let's split up.

00:13:00.733 --> 00:13:02.373
We're not being effective.

00:13:03.633 --> 00:13:07.273
Shu and Marumaro, you focus on
this neighborhood, Area B.

00:13:08.266 --> 00:13:10.096
Jiro and Kluke,
you come with me.

00:13:10.866 --> 00:13:12.896
We'll focus on investigating
Area F.

00:13:13.833 --> 00:13:14.503
Got it?

00:13:14.766 --> 00:13:16.926
Area B and Area F, maro?

00:13:16.966 --> 00:13:18.726
Is something in those areas?

00:13:20.366 --> 00:13:21.026
Let's go.

00:13:31.966 --> 00:13:33.166
Hey, Marumaro.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:33.870
Maro?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:37.170
Do you think this is really
the work of a ghost?

00:13:37.533 --> 00:13:39.073
No doubt about it, maro.

00:13:39.266 --> 00:13:41.696
My sixth sense is
telling me so, maro.

00:13:41.966 --> 00:13:42.996
What's up with that?

00:13:45.266 --> 00:13:45.926
Maro?

00:13:45.966 --> 00:13:46.966
Shu! Look at that...

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:48.770
What is it so late at night?

00:13:49.133 --> 00:13:50.273
We'll go after it, maro!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.170
Right!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.300
It's gone, maro!

00:13:55.833 --> 00:13:57.233
Where did it go?

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.170
Maro...

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:00.970
That's!

00:14:14.533 --> 00:14:15.533
We found her!

00:14:17.233 --> 00:14:18.233
Hold it!

00:14:18.266 --> 00:14:19.426
We'll catch you, maro!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:22.770
She's not here!

00:14:26.266 --> 00:14:27.626
You're the kids from this afternoon!

00:14:28.066 --> 00:14:30.026
What're you doing here?!

00:14:31.266 --> 00:14:33.626
Did you guys see a ghost, maro?!

00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:34.703
Hey...

00:14:34.733 --> 00:14:35.403
What?

00:14:35.433 --> 00:14:38.003
You saw the ghost of
a noblewoman too?!

00:14:38.433 --> 00:14:39.633
"Too"?

00:14:39.666 --> 00:14:42.526
We also came here chasing
after that ghost.

00:14:43.466 --> 00:14:44.126
Shu!

00:14:44.166 --> 00:14:45.166
Over there, maro!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:45.870
Hold it!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:46.770
Hey!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.400
It's gone!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.200
And it's a dead end, maro.

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:55.200
What's happening?!

00:15:01.366 --> 00:15:02.766
What the heck is this?!

00:15:04.766 --> 00:15:05.426
What's that?!

00:15:05.466 --> 00:15:06.626
It's in the direction of the armory!

00:15:07.333 --> 00:15:08.003
Let's go!

00:15:08.333 --> 00:15:10.333
But we're trapped, maro!

00:15:10.366 --> 00:15:12.066
We should use our Shadows!

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:15.400
Oh, that's right.
You're smart, maro.

00:15:15.833 --> 00:15:17.433
That's what
you'd normally think of.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:18.270
Oh.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.070
Good grief.

00:15:26.533 --> 00:15:28.633
She really did it up good.

00:15:28.866 --> 00:15:35.266
Well, it was all possible thanks to me
for attracting the guards' attention.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:44.130
Just leave the rest to
this Master Salinas.

00:15:46.366 --> 00:15:47.366
Good girl.

00:15:47.733 --> 00:15:48.733
Oh-oh.

00:15:49.066 --> 00:15:49.726
Oh!

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.300
The armory door...

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:53.600
Who are you?!

00:15:53.933 --> 00:15:58.833
How did those kids get out?
Good grief.

00:15:59.333 --> 00:16:01.673
You're the one behind these
ghost incidents, right?!

00:16:01.933 --> 00:16:03.273
- No, maro!
- Huh?

00:16:03.466 --> 00:16:06.326
No, maro! He's not the one!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.500
Why not?!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.630
He must be the one,
no matter how you look at it.

00:16:09.966 --> 00:16:11.526
He's not a noblewoman, maro!

00:16:11.666 --> 00:16:13.166
And he doesn't have
an umbrella, maro!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.500
You've got a point, but...

00:16:16.033 --> 00:16:19.833
I wonder if this is
the one you're looking for.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.670
It's a noblewoman Shadow, maro!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:36.000
I get it! The witnesses
saw the Shadow!

00:16:36.833 --> 00:16:39.033
Well, let's just leave it at that.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.330
To think a Shadow was the "ghost."

00:16:41.533 --> 00:16:43.203
We're the defenders of justice!

00:16:43.366 --> 00:16:44.966
We take out the bad guys, maro!

00:16:47.433 --> 00:16:48.703
You guys stand back!

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.170
You guys stand back, maro!

00:16:51.266 --> 00:16:53.566
Only a Shadow can defeat
a Shadow, maro!

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.400
I don't know
what you're talking about,

00:16:55.433 --> 00:16:57.473
but our mission is
to protect the town.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.500
Let's go!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.400
Idiots! Stop!

00:17:07.633 --> 00:17:08.973
Let's go, Marumaro!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:09.670
Maro!

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.200
Shadow Wielders, huh?

00:17:26.633 --> 00:17:27.933
I see. That explains it.

00:17:28.333 --> 00:17:30.033
But you're still kids.

00:17:30.733 --> 00:17:33.303
You'll pay for underestimating
the adult.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.130
Just try it, old man!

00:17:35.433 --> 00:17:36.833
Tactless kids...

00:17:37.566 --> 00:17:40.266
Then I'll show you
the grace of an adult.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:43.030
Dance, Gioconda!

00:17:51.966 --> 00:17:55.896
Hey, you're gonna need a lot more
power than that to fight me!

00:17:56.066 --> 00:17:57.766
Battle isn't about power.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.370
It's about grace!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.830
What're you doing, Shu?!

00:18:10.866 --> 00:18:11.526
Damn it!

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.570
I'll flip up that skirt, maro!

00:18:14.133 --> 00:18:15.833
Just like a kid!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.000
He's strong!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.570
Knock it off! You're just weak!

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:28.600
Shut up!

00:18:28.633 --> 00:18:30.503
We'll put an end to
this right now. Got it?!

00:18:30.966 --> 00:18:31.626
Right!

00:18:37.933 --> 00:18:38.603
Hold it!

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.470
What?! Don't interfere!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.870
We can't shoot from here.

00:18:44.233 --> 00:18:46.473
You can shoot if you want.

00:18:47.666 --> 00:18:50.096
But if you do, the armory
behind me will explode.

00:18:50.433 --> 00:18:51.733
Even a kid should understand that.

00:18:52.466 --> 00:18:54.666
I don't really care what happens.

00:18:54.766 --> 00:18:55.866
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:59.330
What a coincidence.
I don't care what happens either.

00:19:03.633 --> 00:19:04.303
Shu!

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.100
No, you won't.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.000
I won't let you get close.
I'll torture you to death.

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.730
Damn it. What should we do?

00:19:16.133 --> 00:19:18.133
There's no need to think.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:18.970
Huh?

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.230
If I can't shoot fire at them,

00:19:20.266 --> 00:19:22.466
I'll use brute force to put them
out of commission.

00:19:22.966 --> 00:19:25.066
We're struggling because
we can't do that, right?

00:19:26.166 --> 00:19:29.396
Tactless kids and weak soldiers...

00:19:29.433 --> 00:19:33.873
The fortified town of Jibral
isn't much of anything.

00:19:34.166 --> 00:19:37.266
I guess it's about time I have
the armory and all of you destroyed.

00:19:37.333 --> 00:19:38.333
I knew it...

00:19:39.433 --> 00:19:41.703
Easily surmounting
any kind of security

00:19:41.733 --> 00:19:44.733
and executing large-scale pranks
in a short period of time.

00:19:44.866 --> 00:19:48.096
It's impossible for a person,
but possible for a Shadow!

00:19:48.633 --> 00:19:49.773
Who are you?

00:19:50.133 --> 00:19:54.333
I took a closer look at
all seventeen incidents you caused.

00:19:54.533 --> 00:19:57.433
Three of them were
on military facilities.

00:19:57.766 --> 00:20:00.126
The other incidents were
elaborate pranks.

00:20:00.633 --> 00:20:03.703
But those three incidents were
made to look like pranks,

00:20:03.733 --> 00:20:06.333
but were actually
serious subversive acts...

00:20:07.033 --> 00:20:10.473
Turning all the communication equipment
upside down and crippling function.

00:20:11.466 --> 00:20:13.466
Making it look like someone
had prepared a meal,

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.330
but using up all the reserve food
in the storage facility.

00:20:16.633 --> 00:20:18.603
Decorating the outside of
the city's central power plant,

00:20:18.633 --> 00:20:20.673
but destroying the equipment within.

00:20:20.833 --> 00:20:26.833
I can guess the culprit is
a Grankingdom Shadow Wielder.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.870
Another one of
those Grankingdom jerks.

00:20:31.066 --> 00:20:33.666
Oh. So it wasn't a ghost.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.830
Did you think there
really was one?

00:20:36.366 --> 00:20:38.926
Well, I'll say
that's an impressive deduction.

00:20:39.133 --> 00:20:42.133
However, you can't stop me!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:43.530
Shu! Marumaro!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.300
Too slow!

00:20:52.533 --> 00:20:55.233
Let's go! Blue Dragon!

00:20:59.566 --> 00:21:01.296
I don't think so!

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:10.930
Gioconda!

00:21:18.033 --> 00:21:20.603
Go!

00:21:31.933 --> 00:21:33.233
We did it, maro!

00:21:38.766 --> 00:21:40.366
Let me tell you one thing, old man.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:44.270
There's nothing graceful
about what you're doing.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:46.700
It's just something
a small-minded adult would do.

00:21:47.666 --> 00:21:48.666
Okay, let's go.

00:22:04.833 --> 00:22:10.203
See? It's easy to get you guys
inside the castle if I say the word.

00:22:10.633 --> 00:22:12.703
Show a little appreciation.

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:16.000
We went to the trouble of clearing up
the false charge against you!

00:22:16.033 --> 00:22:18.603
Don't say it.
I don't want to remember.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.930
But isn't it great?

00:22:21.333 --> 00:22:23.373
The false charge against you
has been cleared up

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.970
and we can meet the King.

00:22:25.666 --> 00:22:27.426
Well, it's all thanks to me, though.

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:28.870
Don't get all full of yourself.

00:22:29.033 --> 00:22:30.173
It was just a coincidence.

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:31.600
Shut up.

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:35.500
This is it.

00:24:22.066 --> 00:24:24.596
Shu became an avid fan of
the Knight Master after meeting him

00:24:24.633 --> 00:24:26.673
and started buying
Knight Master collectibles.

00:24:26.700 --> 00:24:27.970
Ah! This is it!

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:31.630
The Limited First Edition, Premium Pack
Knight Master special version!

00:24:31.666 --> 00:24:33.026
I'm gonna put it together right now!

00:24:33.066 --> 00:24:36.266
You haven't even put together
the ones you've bought before!

00:24:36.300 --> 00:24:37.630
I am a happy man.

00:24:37.666 --> 00:24:40.166
Next time on Blue Dragon:
"Knight Master."
